  "description": "v054 EXACTLY with ONE change: optim.weight_decay 0.01 -> 1e-4 (100x lower). The optimiser has never been varied in this project -- across 57 versions lr, weight_decay, grad_clip and schedule were all fixed. This opens that surface. Graded against wunderfund's best config (97 submissions).",
